    "sections": {
        "description": "Bosa Finance is a fast, lightweight WordPress theme for accounting company, capital gains, corporate, balance sheet, asset allocation, financial centers, advisors, agency, finance recruitment, consultant, trust accounting, chartered accounting agency, micro-finance bank, fund investment, and start up sites, built for Elementor and WooCommerce. Launch your site visually - no code required. Built with SEO, speed, and usability in mind, Bosa Finance supports custom headers, footers, and mega menus with Elementor, and includes a full starter site you can import in one click. Works seamlessly with Elementor and Gutenberg, and stays compatible with major plugins like WooCommerce, Yoast, Contact Form 7, and Mailchimp. Bosa Finance also works with BEW, an Elementor addon offering widgets, templates, and AI-powered content generation."
    },
